{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_st03","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_09_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-ST-3","storyName":"祝好 终途的我","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"旅程已经结束，但她们在雷姆必拓留下的故事仍在继续。又回到了大涌泉镇，不在温泉里玩玩怎么能行呢？","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_st03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["悲观的保镖","乐天的司机","衣帽间里的男声","衣帽间里的女声","优雅的夫人","严厉的先生","活泼的女孩","愉快的矿工","太阳谷维修员","太阳谷联络员","塔妮父亲","巴尼特","好事的村民","塔妮母亲","乌露露","嘉辛塔","阿梅利亚","玛蒂娜","塔妮","安洁莉娜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_cg_letter.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_76_g13_worldend.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$holiday_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_holiday_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":10},{"type":"sticker","id":11,"text":"给博士：","x":"200","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":12,"text":"\\n我之前其实……没想过要给你写信的。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"text":"\\n我是罗德岛的信使，无论在外漂泊多久，我最终都会回去，所以，为什么要给你写信呢？","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":14,"text":"\\n但我仍然在一踏上回程旅途，从雷姆必拓的南境开始返回终极大铁屯的时刻，就开始给你写这封信了。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":16,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"sticker","id":18,"text":"\\n去程的事情，我会在行动记录中事无巨细地提及，所以不用担心读不懂……","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":19,"text":"\\n……可是这样想来，回程的事不也会写在行动记录里面吗？","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":20,"text":"\\n但我仍然要给你写这封信。因为这趟旅程——无论去程还是回程——都是一段太过愉快的经历，愉快到让人感到遗憾……","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":21,"text":"\\n……为你不在我们身边而遗憾。","multi":"true","x":"200","y":"260","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"900","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":22,"duration":"1"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":23},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"charslot","id":26},{"type":"image","id":27},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_bg_deluxeroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":30},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$RimBillitonDaily_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_rimbillitondaily_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":31,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_020","duration":"0.5","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"先生和夫人在衣帽间里待了多久了？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"急什么。无非又是和核心圈诸国的贸易代表开会而已。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"反正这场会没有坎贝尔夫妇就开不起来，先生和夫人愿意拖就拖着呗，说不定也是谈判策略呢。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"可我听说那些贸易代表已经开始私下建立攻守同盟了，情况可能没我们想象得那么乐观……","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的男声","text":"……我去挑一条领带，好不好……","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的男声","text":"这条动物的实在是……","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"你看，还挑领带呢，根本就不着急。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"动物图案的？先生从来没打过动物图案的领带，该不会是某种暗号……情况有变？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的女声","text":"……她当年就想看你系这条领带，你当时也是用这句话把她打发了……","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"“她”？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"“当年”？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":55},{"type":"text","text":"乐天的司机和悲观的保镖都不说话了。两人虽然没有离开原位，却都竖起了耳朵，使劲捕捉衣帽间里传来的每一丝语音。","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的男声","text":"……可你至少也在外面给我留点面子……","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的女声","text":"……这件事不解释清楚，就别怪我一点面子都不给你！","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的男声","text":"我会道歉的，我真的会道歉的，但这条动物领带还是——","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"衣帽间里的男声","text":"好好好……","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_020","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"先生、夫人！如果都准备好了，我们就前往大铁屯会议中心——","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"大铁屯会议中心？","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"不、不是吗？","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"夫人，恕我直言，就算这次的贸易代表里有，呃，跟先生之前有因缘的人，也不好因私废公——","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严厉的先生","text":"啊？我们要去看嘉辛塔和她的朋友们，你们在说什么？","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乐天的司机","text":"嘉辛塔？那这条领带……","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_329_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"他第一次送嘉辛塔去疗养院之前，嘉辛塔就想看他系这条领带，结果他用一句“太不庄重”把嘉辛塔打发了。","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"之前嘉辛塔在大铁屯的事迹你们想必也听说了，利亚姆·坎贝尔接下来要去给他的女儿接风，顺带道歉。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"悲观的保镖","text":"原来是这样……","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_020.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"现在，先生们，轮到你们向我解释，刚刚那些“有因缘的人”“因私废公”是什么意思了。","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"charslot","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_bg_76_g5_sunvalleycom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"爸爸爸爸，那个柜子上是不是多了什么东西呀？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"就数你眼尖。那是今年击球大赛的照片，要我给你取下来看看吗？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#2$1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"好呀！","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_close_glasscabinet","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"照片上是……四个穿得很漂亮的姐姐？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"爸爸，她们为什么不穿工服呀？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"因为她们本来也不是太阳谷的矿工，她们是来帮忙修通讯塔，顺带参加击球大赛的。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#1$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"那通讯塔修好了吗？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"修好了呀。不光修好了，她们还在矿井下面救了个人出来呢。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#2$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"姐姐们太了不起了！那她们击球大赛得了第几名呀？她们得了冠军吗？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"哼哼……修塔和救人先不说，要在击球场上击败你爸爸我？她们还嫩着呢！","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_close_glasscabinet","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#4$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"这才是今年的冠军奖杯，爸爸赢过来的！怎么样，好不好看？想不想要？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#3$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"爸爸坏！爸爸不让姐姐们得冠军！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"不是，这是比赛——","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#3$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"我要这张照片嘛！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"小祖宗你等等，可别把照片弄坏了。我去问问胶卷在谁手里，什么时候再洗一张……","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"刚刚塔妮她们来了，要找大家聚一聚，参加了击球大赛的人都去了，就差你一个人啦。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#3$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"这不是巧了吗？走走走，爸爸带你找姐姐们合影去！","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2358_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷维修员","text":"说起来，其他人还问联络员先生在不在呢。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_2358_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#1$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"他？他可能去不了吧。通讯塔修好之后他出去跑生意，好像真的出了场不大不小的车祸，回总部疗养来了。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#4$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"巴顿先生在吗？我好得差不多了，可不可以结束疗养——","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#2$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"呀，联络员先生！","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愉快的矿工","text":"唔，你好了呀。走，我们一起！","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_avg_npc_2354_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"一、一起去干嘛？！","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2362_1#2$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"活泼的女孩","text":"参加击球大赛的人都去了，联络员叔叔也去！","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_2362_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2354_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"击球大赛？！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2363_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太阳谷联络员","text":"哎呦呦呦呦呦呦呦……","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_npc_2363_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":173},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_bg_31_g4_mini12_village.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":176},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_path_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":177,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-100,0","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"100,0","posto":"100,0","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"喝了这么多天，每次喝你们的胡萝卜酿我都在想，你们这儿的胡萝卜是真好。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"l","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴尼特","text":"可不是嘛。糖度高，不爱坏，风味好……拿来晾胡萝卜干也太可惜了！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"这不是村里没那么多能喝酒的人嘛！","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"正巧我还想问你们呢，你们大涌泉镇缺不缺胡萝卜酿？要是能互通有无——","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"这么好的胡萝卜酿，雷姆必拓哪里不缺？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","id":191},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的村民","text":"好！太好了！喝！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2355_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巴尼特","text":"喝！","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_npc_2355_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"喝——","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"dialog","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2360_1#5$1","duration":"0.5","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"停！","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#4$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"麦迪森，生意谈到一半，马上就好，就一小会儿——","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2360_1#3$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"生意？和塔妮一起来的三个小姑娘已经把生意谈好啦。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#3$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"连这都比我快一步？！","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2360_1#1$1","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"一周前坎贝尔家的小姑娘就已经联系了附近的冰淇淋工厂，洋蓟村的特产就要变成胡萝卜筒冰淇淋了。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"现在胡萝卜筒冰淇淋的试产已经完成，她们已经先上路啦。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#4$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"啊？那我让塔妮带的照片？","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2360_1#5$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"等你回家才能看到了！走了！","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2359_1#3$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮父亲","text":"你别揪我耳朵——我妈当年就是老揪我耳朵，才把我耳朵揪这么长的！我一直觉得我妈的短耳朵好——","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_2359_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2360_1#3$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮母亲","text":"你耳朵哪里长了？你们仨的耳朵都是一个模子刻出来的！","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_npc_2360_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"charslot","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_76_g4_dailytown.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_mictest","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":228},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","offset":"0,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":229},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"50,0","pto":"50,0","name":"avg_npc_2347_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"特大喜讯，特大喜讯！","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"经由阿梅利亚小姐的修理，大涌泉镇的远程通讯现已恢复！","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"因此，现在由本人，“引领者”乌露露，经由“泰拉重生之后”电台，给大涌泉镇的各位带来一则特大喜讯！","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#8$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"哇，乌露露的声音还是这么大……","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我、我其实已经按你说的，偷偷调过她电台的音量了，根本没用，为什么啊……","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2345_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"因为这样一来她就会以为是自己声音不够大了。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_2345_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不愧是玛蒂娜女士……我根本没想到这一点……","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$2","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"呜哇，温泉都震起波纹了……","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"interlude","maskid":"group_interclude_vertical_common","size":"290,760","style":"0","offset":"0,0","channel":"3","tsfrom":"0,1","tsto":"1,1","tsduration":"0","id":253},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"50,0","pto":"50,0","name":"avg_npc_2347_1#1$1","duration":"0","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"为了庆祝大涌泉镇恢复远程通讯！","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"也为了庆祝安洁莉娜、塔妮、嘉辛塔、阿梅利亚顺利从南境回归！","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"大涌泉镇现在特开展冰淇淋免费派送活动！最新研发的胡萝卜筒冰淇淋，将在整个大涌泉镇免费派送！","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"大家一定好奇，冰淇淋该如何免费派送对不对？","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"让我们欢迎来自罗德岛的源石技艺大师，操纵重力的——安洁莉娜！安心院安洁莉娜小姐！","id":260},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":261},{"type":"3","channel":"3","slot":"m","switch":"true","pfrom":"50,0","pto":"50,0","name":"avg_npc_2347_1#8$1","duration":"0","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌露露","text":"然后……在颠倒的重力之下——为胡萝卜筒冰淇淋——欢呼吧！","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_imp_funnel_end_h","id":265},{"type":"interlude","channel":"3","clear":"true","tsfrom":"1,1","tsto":"0,1","tsduration":"0.5","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"说得那么大张旗鼓，可我们只有这么一箱啊……","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嗐，怕什么，话都说出去了，先上再说！再等下去，温泉的热气都要渗到冰淇淋箱里了！","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安洁莉娜！","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"好嘞！","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"background","id":279},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_76_i15_2.png","fadetime":"0","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"0","y":"-10","id":280},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i15_1","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"1","sto":"1.1","sduration":"0","id":281},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":282},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_chill_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":283,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"安洁莉娜打开手中的保温箱——","id":284},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cuteappear","id":287},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i15_4","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"0.9","sto":"1.1","sduration":"0.5","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"胡萝卜筒冰淇淋一个又一个地从箱里飞出，在温泉氤氲的蒸汽中蹦跳起来。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_jump_water","volume":"0.9","id":291},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_shuihua","layer":"1","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":294},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_76_i15_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":295},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.0","yScaleTo":"1.0","duration":"30","block":"false","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"在冰淇淋的诱惑之下，长耳朵的卡特斯情不自禁地跳入温泉之中。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"短耳朵的卡特斯原本也想下水，却发觉身旁的阿纳缇拿在手里的冰淇淋被什么小东西叼走了——","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"欸？为什么你的“小飞虫”会抢你的冰淇淋？","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"那个不是“小飞虫”，那个是——呃，很难解释啊，呜……","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"欸，不是“小飞虫”吗？我一直以为那个是羽兽形态的重装小飞虫，你的终极武器之类的……","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"不好解释就先放一放！来，我手头的这个冰淇淋给你！","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"而之前被乌露露的超大音量广播震回家里的镇民，还有来疗养的感染者们，也纷纷从为了隔音紧闭的门扉里探出头来，而后飞奔出门。","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"玛蒂娜，不一起来吗？","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"我的口味和你比较像，对胡萝卜没那么感冒——你也是因为这个才主动要求来当派送员的吧？","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"嘿嘿……","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"要是一撮毛也在这里就好了。让它帮忙派送冰淇淋，说不定能让更多人真正认识这种可爱的生物……","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"说到有袋鼷兽，你知道那个有袋鼷兽被人敲了脑袋，结果长出绒毛躲去南境的故事吗？","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"嗯，塔妮跟我讲过。","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"这个故事还有下半截，你知道吗？","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"下半截？","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"据说在很久很久之后，在说出口的话会在转瞬之间到达千里之外，人们已经忘却了什么叫说不出口的时候……","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"会有一只有袋鼷兽离开它们代代居住的南境。","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"它无论如何都想重新学会阅读和聆听，因此，它会寻找一位与多年前那个雷姆必拓人同样勇敢的信使。","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"一人一兽会重新踏上旅途，但这次不是为了传信，而是传递那些被又多又杂乱的话语蒙蔽的，真正的心意……","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"难道您是想说，一撮毛就是那只有袋鼷兽？可它现在已经回到了南境，和它的爸爸妈妈团聚了呀。","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……这个故事该不是您现编出来逗我开心的吧？","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"哈哈，故事总有添油加醋的成分，可谁又能说故事背后一定没有一个真实的原型呢？","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"真是的……","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛蒂娜","text":"与其纠结故事的真伪，不如先享受这一刻吧。我给你拍个照片！来，笑一个——","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_screenshot","layer":"1","id":324},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":325},{"type":"playsound","key":"$skill_flash","volume":"0.9","id":326},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_76_i15_1.png","fadetime":"0.5","xScale":"1.01","yScale":"1.01","screenadapt":"coverall","id":327},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_76_i16_6","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"0.95","sto":"0.9","sduration":"0.3","rfrom":"0","rto":"5","rduration":"0.3","id":328},{"type":"imagerotate","angle":"5","fadetime":"0.3","inverse":"true","id":329},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"是的，博士，就是这样一趟愉快的旅途。","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"不光是这张照片承载的场景，也不光是前面的文字记叙的欢乐。","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"每一次重逢都让人感到温暖，每一次再见都指向新的可能。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"哪怕离别仍然近在眼前——","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"——不，请别误会，我说的是，玛蒂娜婉拒了来罗德岛的邀请……","id":336},{"type":"dialog","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"image","id":340},{"type":"imagerotate","angle":"0","fadetime":"0","inverse":"true","id":341},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":342},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_bg_desert_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"她给我看了一封没有收件人，也没有寄件人的信。","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"她说，和我共同走过这段旅途之后，她忽然又生出了一些额外的勇气，去解决这个困扰她许久的问题……","id":346},{"type":"text","text":"……于是，她在离开雷姆必拓之后，在荒地上告别了我们。","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"在那之后，我们又解决了一些问题。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"阿梅利亚和嘉辛塔敲定了拉特兰作为创业的起点，跟他们的枢机聊了一整个下午。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮一路勘测地形，已经为大涌泉镇的镇民找好了三四处潜在可移居的地点，唯一的问题是这些地方好像都在公认的雷姆必拓境外。","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":354},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-900","fadetime":"0","id":355},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"30","yFrom":"300","yTo":"250","block":"false","id":356},{"type":"backgroundtween","duration":"15","yTo":"0","block":"false","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"而我……我想了很多很多事情。","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"已经发生的，正在发生的，尚未发生的……","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"许多事情我还想不清楚，但唯独在那封信中向玛蒂娜提出的问题，我已经有了答案。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"我是罗德岛的信使安洁莉娜。","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"在你需要我的时候，我会像你当时为我伸出援助之手一样，坚定地站在你的身边。","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"呼……","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"……想说的话还有很多，但这张信纸已经被我写满，连个落款的地方都没有了。","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"但是没关系。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"从我想说的话挤满了信纸，再也写不下一个字的那一刻起——","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"——我就会向你飞奔而来。","id":369},{"type":"dialog","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"gridbg","id":373},{"type":"background","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"377","text":"那么……"}},"values":[],"id":376},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":377,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_072cg_dawn","layer":"2","x":"100","y":"0","id":381},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_76_i14.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","id":382},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"60","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"明媚的日光下，信使的朋友们好奇地看向你。","id":385},{"type":"text","text":"一路上，她们已经从安洁莉娜的口中听过你的许多事迹。","id":386},{"type":"text","text":"不光是在晶簇前消沉的她，还有在南境的帐篷里努力入睡的她，看着地图计算距离的她，在归途的风中哼歌的她……","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"她总会不经意地提起你，在三人心中激起一次又一次想象。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"而今，你终于站在了她们面前。","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"这位耳朵短短的卡特斯是塔妮，她是大涌泉镇的探路者，是个了不起的探险家！","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"这位耳朵长长的卡特斯是嘉辛塔，这位阿纳缇是阿梅利亚！","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"阿梅利亚是很厉害的通讯技术专家，梦想是连接整片大地，而嘉辛塔是她的投资人！","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"各位，这位就是博士，罗德岛的博士！","id":393},{"type":"text","text":"你微笑着对着她们点头致意。","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"就算隔着兜帽，她们显然也感受到了你的善意，就连最容易紧张的阿梅利亚也明显松弛下来。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"介绍完后，从旅途归来的信使送给你一个笑容……","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"一个你之前未在那张脸上见过的，比日光还要灿烂的笑容。","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"博士，我回来了！","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"403","text":"欢迎回来，安洁莉娜。"}},"values":[],"id":402},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":403,"end":404},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"bgeffect","id":407},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":408},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":409},{"type":"image","id":410},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":411}],"characters":["悲观的保镖","乐天的司机","衣帽间里的男声","衣帽间里的女声","优雅的夫人","严厉的先生","活泼的女孩","愉快的矿工","太阳谷维修员","太阳谷联络员","塔妮父亲","巴尼特","好事的村民","塔妮母亲","乌露露","嘉辛塔","阿梅利亚","玛蒂娜","塔妮","安洁莉娜"]}